{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class wedss {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        if (n <= 11) {\n            long[][] points = new long[n][5];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < 5; j++) {\n                    points[i][j] = sc.nextLong();\n                }\n            }\n\n            long[][][] vectors = new long[n][n][5];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n                    for (int k = 0; k < 5; k++) {\n                        vectors[i][j][k] = points[j][k] - points[i][k];\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            Set<Integer> marked = new HashSet<>();\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                boolean found = false;\n                for (int j = 0; j < n && !found; j++) {\n                    for (int k = 0; k < n; k++) {\n                        if (!Arrays.equals(vectors[i][j], vectors[i][k]) && computeDot(vectors[i][j], vectors[i][k]) > 0) {\n                            marked.add(i + 1);\n                            found = true;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            int count = 0;\n            for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n                if (!marked.contains(i)) count++;\n            }\n            System.out.println(count);\n            for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n                if (!marked.contains(i)) {\n                    System.out.println(i);\n                }\n            }\n        } else {\n            System.out.println(0);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static long computeDot(long[] a, long[] b) {\n        long sum = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n            sum += a[i] * b[i];\n        }\n        return sum;\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <set>\n#include <cstring>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long computeDot(const vector<long long>& a, const vector<long long>& b) {\n    long long sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        sum += a[i] * b[i];\n    }\n    return sum;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    cin >> n;\n    \n    if (n <= 11) {\n        vector<vector<long long>> points(n, vector<long long>(5));\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < 5; j++) {\n                cin >> points[i][j];\n            }\n        }\n\n        vector<vector<vector<long long>>> vectors(n, vector<vector<long long>>(n, vector<long long>(5)));\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n                for (int k = 0; k < 5; k++) {\n                    vectors[i][j][k] = points[j][k] - points[i][k];\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        set<int> marked;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            bool found = false;\n            for (int j = 0; j < n && !found; j++) {\n                for (int k = 0; k < n; k++) {\n                    if (vectors[i][j] != vectors[i][k] && computeDot(vectors[i][j], vectors[i][k]) > 0) {\n                        marked.insert(i + 1);\n                        found = true;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            if (marked.find(i) == marked.end()) {\n                count++;\n            }\n        }\n        cout << count << endl;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            if (marked.find(i) == marked.end()) {\n                cout << i << endl;\n            }\n        }\n    } else {\n        cout << 0 << endl;\n    }\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.689979586051777e-05, -5.125986263010418e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00013398226292338222, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.9192511899746023e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -5.602820692729438e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -2.1219027985353023e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00016258825780823827, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.08503145724534988, -1.9073304429184645e-05, -8.535020606359467e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.2896057069301605, -0.5759444832801819, -0.23207126557826996, -6.437280717364047e-06, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0004183370911050588, -0.06995701789855957, -0.0001530530134914443, -1.8358061424805783e-05, -0.0038340408354997635, -1.7046782886609435e-05, -3.2305197237292305e-05, -4.529942543740617e-06, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.529942543740617e-06, -1.4781842764932662e-05, -2.825220326485578e-05, -1.168244216387393e-05, 0.0, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.622600959512056e-06, -4.76